{
    "UniqueID": "hw_athame",
    "//Athame": "Feature 25's athame and feature 26's two rites that use it (plan sections 25 and 26, pack Prompt 35; W0-16, W0-23). A CT0 knife on vanilla Knife_Bone's shape (5b09c8bbba1aa0348ba58dc4a9fa8f27: UsageDurability 40, a bone blade) carrying tag_Cutter, the runtime name of the export's Button_8055, so it also butchers a carcass. Player-made (hw_bp_athame), so no [Threats] switch. TWO RITES, each a DismantleAction on this card, never an edit of a vanilla card. LET BLOOD hands the player vanilla W_ArmLacerationL (98f10547125d5614f951a14a11fba847, an open arm wound) and writes vanilla BeastAffinity +150 (0 to 1000, base rate -0.1 a tick, so the write fades and is NOT permanent; W0-16: a calling needs BeastAffinity 250). It NEVER writes BloodLoss or Pain (base rate 0, so an action write would be permanent; the wound card carries the cost). A second cut is refused while that wound is open: an Inverted RequiredCardsOnBoard entry on the wound. CALL RAIN writes vanilla Rainmaker +20 (Tgr_Rainmaker 'Refresh Weather' fires at 20 or more) and Clouds +250 (350 base, so about 600, where W0-23 inferred about seven refreshes in ten are rain, and only Torrential from 746); it never edits a weather card. A hidden hw_stat_rite_rain cools it for two days. INCENSE: each rite has four extra DismantleActions, one per lit incense card (Herbs and Fungi's lit incense bundle and Community Mod Chest's comfortincenseburnerlit, comfortincenseburnerheatherlit, comfortincenseburnerjuniperlit), whose ONLY foreign UniqueID sits in a RequiredCardsOnBoard condition row (so a smoke rite is simply hidden until that card is on the board; two or more can show together, so each has its own name). With the sibling mod absent the condition's card does not resolve; Patcher/IncenseRiteGuard.cs then removes that action at load, so with neither mod installed no incense row has any effect. Every number is a TUNABLE PLACEHOLDER, session-inferred and unmeasured against play. Gated by Development_Tools/Tests/HarshWilds-Rituals.Tests.ps1 ([rituals], row athame).",
    "CardType": 0,
    "CardName": {
        "LocalizationKey": "HarshWilds_Athame_CardName",
        "DefaultText": "Athame"
    },
    "CardDescription": {
        "LocalizationKey": "HarshWilds_Athame_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A short bone-bladed knife with a hilt wrapped in blackened twine, kept for rites. It cuts and butchers like any knife. With it you can let your own blood for the beasts, or call down rain; a lit incense burner or bundle nearby makes either rite stronger."
    },
